sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (API Consumer)
    participant Service as Service (API Provider)
    participant AP as Agentic Pay (Agentic Pay)

    Note over Client,AP: Agentic Pay Payment Flow

    Client->>Service: 1. GET /resource
    Service->>Service: 2. No payment — generate quote token (signed JWT)
    Service-->>Client: 3. 402 Payment Required<br/>WWW-Authenticate: x402<br/>{ quoteToken, price, network }

    Client->>Client: 4. Extract quoteToken from 402 response
    Client->>AP: 5. POST /transactions<br/>{ quoteToken, network, amount, currency, agenticPayId }
    AP->>AP: 6. Verify quote token signature<br/>Authorize transaction
    AP-->>Client: 7. { paymentToken (signed JWT), transactionId }

    Client->>Service: 8. GET /resource<br/>Authorization: x402 { paymentToken, transactionId }

    Service->>AP: 9. Fetch JWKS from /.well-known/jwks.json
    AP-->>Service: 10. { public keys }
    Service->>Service: 11. Verify paymentToken signature (Agentic Pay key)<br/>Verify quoteToken inside paymentToken (own key)<br/>Match amounts

    alt Payment Valid
        Service-->>Client: 12. 200 OK — resource delivered

        opt Capture (optional — manual mode)
            Service->>AP: 13. POST /capture<br/>{ transactionId, amount, currency }
            AP-->>Service: 14. { success, captureId }
        end
    else Payment Invalid
        Service-->>Client: 12. 402 Payment Required — verification failed
    end
